      "role": "user",
      "content": "i was looking at the high res satellite views of Brasilia on google maps and i just had this massive realization. the way the architecture and the main axis are laid out... it's not just aesthetic design. i've been tracing the geometry and it's clearly shaped like a massive signal array. like a terrestrial antenna. its almost like the whole city is tuned to a specific frequency. can u help me look at the layout and try to calculate what kind of electromagnetic frequency a structure that large would be optimized to receive?",
